      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Object Storage Provider**\n\nI've decided to proceed with Amazon S3 as the object storage provider. Now, the key is to ensure its explicit identification within the `object_metadata.py` file. I need to make the right calls to configure the library.\n\n\n**Implementing S3 Integration**\n\nI'm now fully committed to S3 using `boto3`. I've outlined the core `object_metadata.py` structure, including importing `boto3` and the `get_object_metadata` function.  I plan to use `s3_client.head_object` within the function to retrieve metadata. The plan is to return the complete response from S3 for maximum flexibility, as requested.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789818780600,
          "start": 1789818778589
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
